title: "Privacy Firewall"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Suraj
    family-names: Songara
repository-code: "https://github.com/SurajSongara/privacy-firewall"
abstract: >-
  Offline-first PII detection and redaction engine for PDFs, images, and text
  documents. Deterministic (regex + checksum) detectors, true content-stream
  redaction, and a self-verifying audit certificate — all running locally.
keywords:
  - pii
  - redaction
  - privacy
  - pdf
  - ocr
